msgid "You cannot delete your account because you own more than 1 organization."
msgstr "由于您拥有多个组织，所以无法删除您的帐户。"

msgid ""
"You are the owner of multiple consumer organizations.\n"
"                        You can delete your account only when you are the owner of a single organization.\n"
"                        Please transfer the ownership of, or delete, the other organizations before you delete your account."
msgstr ""
"您是多个使用者组织的所有者。\n"
"                        只有当您是单个组织的所有者时，才能删除自己的帐户。\n"
"                        请在删除帐户之前，先移交其他组织的所有权或删除其他组织。"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

msgid "Are you sure you want to delete your account? This action cannot be undone. This action will also remove the organization you own. This permanently removes access to the organization, and all of its applications and subscriptions, for all members of the organization. Please note that once an organization has been deleted, it cannot be reactivated. You might want to consider changing ownership of your Developer organizations, before deleting your account."
msgstr "确定要删除您的帐户？此操作无法撤销。此操作还将移除您拥有的组织。这将永久移除组织所有成员对组织及其所有应用程序和预订的访问权。请注意，一旦删除组织，就无法将其重新激活。在删除帐户之前，您可能需要考虑更改开发人员组织的所有权。"

msgid "Are you sure you want to delete your account? This action cannot be undone."
msgstr "确定要删除您的帐户？此操作无法撤销。"

